<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U says Fragmin gets Swedish, British nod.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U says Fragmin gets Swedish, British nod.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish/U.S. drugs group Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn said on Monday it had received approval in Sweden and Britain to sell Fragmin for the treatment of unstable coronary arteries.</p>
</text>
